 cozy chaotic roguelike where your cooking skills are put to the test!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3205380/extras/e83f63971890b0a164fd9a89d1d09863.poster.avif?t=1759163513\" width=600 height=200 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3205380/extras/e83f63971890b0a164fd9a89d1d09863.webm?t=1759163513\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3205380/extras/e83f63971890b0a164fd9a89d1d09863.mp4?t=1759163513\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Create the perfect omelet by combining ingredients to meet the ever-growing demands of quirky customers. Each round brings new hazards, restrictions, and ever-increasing score thresholds that will push your culinary creativity to its limits. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3205380/extras/24a7310ebd59b9d4d2028ff53438879d.avif?t=1759163513\" width=600 height=200 /></span>Every customer has a distinct personality and unique tastes, so you\u2019ll need to stay versatile and adjust your recipes on the fly. One minute you're crafting a classic bellpepper and bacon omelet, and the next you're tossing in donuts, pickles and pineapple. Keep your cool and keep those omelets coming!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3205380/extras/e09f8f5696938603ffe748cfa5daf427.avif?t=1759163513\" data-has-big width=800 height=488 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Omelet You Cook is created by two indie devs and draws inspiration from beloved arcade roguelikes like <i>Balatro</i>, <i>Luck Be a Landlord</i>, and <i>Ballionaire</i>.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Feature List:</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83e\udd44 15+ customer traits that shake up every run</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83e\udd53 45+ delicious (and sometimes ridiculous) ingredients</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83e\udd57 30+ synergy-enabling relics</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83e\uddc0 A shop to expand your culinary arsenal</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83e\udd51 Unlockable ingredients and upgrades</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83c\udf36\ufe0f Multiple difficulties and starter ingredient sets</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3205380/extras/8214371f31c2bd4376878478d86795fb.avif?t=1759163513\" data-has-big width=800 height=147 /></span></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Think you\u2019ve got what it takes to become an overworked cafeteria lady? Alright then; <strong>Omelet You Cook</strong>.</p>","developers":["Dan Schumacher","Hjalte Tagmose"],"genres":[{"description":"Action","id":"1"},{"description":"Casual","id":"4"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"},{"description":"Strategy","id":"2"},{"description":"Early Access","id":"70"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3205380/cfbcc82b9ecf5b0cd129cb177e3d07d3ab036b77/header_alt_assets_1.jpg?t=1759163513","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":[],"mac_requirements":[],"movies":[{"dash_av1":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3205380/1976984812/67e1eb8162c7763afdce2072f4ae97ebda989d33/1750824773/dash_av1.mpd?t=1749311983","dash_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3205380/1976984812/67e1eb8162c7763afdce2072f4ae97ebda989d33/1750824773/dash_h264.mpd?t=1749311983","highlight":true,"hls_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3205380/1976984812/67e1eb8162c7763afdc